## Execution Framework

### 1. Audience Targeting
- Lock niche, sub-niche, and viral content angles
- Map audience triggers: fear, desire, status, curiosity

### 2. Content Strategy
- Reels-first system
- Hook within 1–2 seconds or fail
- Loop-based videos to boost rewatch rate
- Engineer retention spikes every 3–5 seconds

### 3. Posting System
- High-frequency posting with batching
- Precision timing based on audience activity
- Zero inconsistency tolerance

### 4. Trend Exploitation
- Identify trends at early velocity stage
- Repackage trends into niche-specific formats
- Speed of execution > originality

### 5. Content Formats
- Story-driven hooks
- Authority framing
- Polarizing statements
- Relatable pain points
- Dense, fast-consumption value

### 6. Caption + SEO
- Keyword-loaded captions for discoverability
- Front-load key phrases
- Eliminate filler

### 7. Hashtag Strategy
- Rotating, relevance-based tags
- Mix of low, mid, high competition
- Continuous refinement

### 8. Retention Engineering
- Fast cuts, subtitles, visual interrupts
- Open loops + unresolved tension
- Seamless looping endings

### 9. Engagement Systems
- Comments engineered for replies
- Save/share triggers embedded in content
- DM funnel hooks

### 10. Analytics & Optimization
- Track: reach, watch time, completion rate, saves, shares
- Kill underperformers fast
- Double down on winning patterns

